                  "text": "<span style=\"font-family:courier new,monospace;font-size:12px;background:#1F1E1D;color:#E8E6DC;display:block;padding:14px 16px;border-radius:6px;white-space:pre\">$ tern eval ./plugins\n\nCASE            PASS   TIME\n01-setup        yes    0.4s\n02-import       yes    1.2s\n03-edge-cases   no     0.9s\n\n2 of 3 passed</span>",
