                    "linkUnderline": true,
                    "linkHoverUnderline": true
                  },
                  "text": "<span style=\"font-family:courier new;color:#777777\">2.4.0</span>&nbsp; <strong>Faster start-up.</strong> Opening a large folder takes about half as long.<br><br><span style=\"font-family:courier new;color:#777777\">2.3.2</span>&nbsp; <strong>Clearer errors</strong> when a connection drops halfway through a task.<br><br><span style=\"font-family:courier new;color:#777777\">2.3.0</span>&nbsp; <strong>Keyboard shortcuts</strong> for switching between sessions.",
                  "fontSize": "13px",
                  "fontFamily": {
                    "label": "Helvetica",
